OL,3,AMan named Hitler Mussolini elected
OL,4,Amayor in Peru
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man named Hitler Mussolini Simeon
OL,7,FFlores has secured a narrow victory in
OL,8,FPeru's local elections, exit polls
OL,9,Fshow.
OL,11,FThe candidate for the centre-left Ahora
OL,12,FNacion party was elected mayor of
OL,13,FQueropalca, a remote district in the
OL,14,FPeruvian Andes.
OL,16,FSome 229 residents voted for the
OL,17,F45-year-old, putting him ahead of the
OL,18,Fsecond-place candidate from right-wing
OL,19,FRenovacion Popular Peru by just 25
OL,20,Fvotes.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
