OL,3,AMan named Hitler Mussolini elected
OL,4,Amayor in Peru
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite being elected to represent
OL,7,Ffewer than 1,000 people, his forenames
OL,8,Fbeing those of two notorious fascist
OL,9,Fdictators has drawn outsized
OL,10,Finternational attention to the small
OL,11,Fcorner of the country.
